; RFC 9942 (COSE Receipts) -- Section 5.2.1, "Receipt of Inclusion"
; Figure 4: "Protected Header for a Receipt of Inclusion"
; Source: rfc9942.txt lines 487-491; figure caption at line 493.
;
; Copied VERBATIM, including the RFC's left margin and the absence of
; commas between group entries.
;
; 1 rule: protected-header-map.
;
; This block does NOT compile standalone and does NOT concatenate with the
; rest of the document as written. Two reasons, both preserved here:
;   * "cose-label" (line 490) is defined only in Figure 1, not here;
;   * "cose-value" (line 490, SINGULAR) is defined NOWHERE in RFC 9942.
;     Figure 1 line 239 defines "cose-values", plural.
; The rule name "protected-header-map" also collides with Figure 8.
; See README.md, "Defects".
;
; -- verbatim extract begins (source line 487) --
   protected-header-map = {
     &(alg: 1) => int
     &(vds: 395) => int
     * cose-label => cose-value
   }
; -- verbatim extract ends (source line 491) --
